        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kaganv tat khou niu ni tatbam.",
            "Tingmik tat pui thei laina.",
            "Niu mi kandih hei patlouna",
            "Niu kai tyngkau thu tat ni.",
            "",
            "Kagan rui tatmei kum niu ni tat bam ] 2",
            "Aniu rui aniu kai thang zuan tat bam,",
            "Kagan rui tatmei kum niu ni tat bam.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkum khumna niu tat guang the,",
            "Panti lung kei lungku na;",
            "Aniu lung rianra neila na",
            "Aniu kaap guat nui guat na.",
            "",
            "3. Oh! tingmik thui pouta lum kho,",
            "Chumpui chang khou zailou khang;",
            "Aniu guai chang man dat mak khang ,",
            "Zingmei paap khou tat mak khang.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih panti chaeng hei tatna",
            "Neikhat neikhat tat guang na,",
            "Bumaeng lungpui ram tang ni the,",
            "Niu chang kam hei luai pui nung ."
          ]
        }
      }
